 "summary": "Lochinvar's Lectrus KEB electric boilers expose Modbus RTU through an RS-485 communication board. The BAS writes a configuration word, an enable word, a rate or setpoint command and optional remote temperatures; it reads safety-switch and pump states, outlet/inlet temperatures, modulation rate, pump speeds, cascade power and status/blocking/lockout codes.",
